; M2-BPR-07: the Ch2 tideline below Haluna at noon (greybox; env-art dresses it). Grade from
; docs/kb/art/color_script.md ch02_noon: sun 74 deg, 3.2, exposure 0.65, saturation x1.12; the sandbox's lagoon
; sky. BattleArena moves this scene's children into the battle scene in place of its WorldEnvironment, Sun and
; Arena. The fight is on the wet sand where the tide has just gone out: dry sand behind the party, a dark wet band,
; then the lagoon behind the foes.

